> Players are teleported to the human village

> Objective have the biggest sale after 5 days (Each day consists of 30 rounds and after 30th round the selling phase begins)

> Players will set up their own stalls

> Players will sell items they procure

> Players will need to convince people to buy their items

> Players need to advertise their stalls

> Players will need to do performance and other ways to attract customers

> Players may use persuasion, deception, intimidation to increase price of items

> Players can sabotage other players stalls or create false rumors to lose customers

> Players can do whatever they can (Help with imagination)

> Players can do certain actions thats costs 1-6 Rounds to do things like crafting gathering adverstising etc.

> Each round is 5 minutes
