> Four stalls located at the center of the human village each stall at their own quadrant. (Can be expanded by building new stalls).

> Instructions are given
1.) The stalls are currently empty and nothing can be sold. You may use any methods you can to procure items that can be sold. 
2.) There will be various activities that can be done each taking an amount of time to do so. Depending on the activity skill checks will be necessary.
3.) At the end of each day, all players will only be able to sell items on their stalls. And whoever has the most money by the end of the fifth day will receive the best rewards.
4.) When manning a stall, you will require one of your party member to be assigned there. Whoever is assigned is responsible for their items and things to sell.
5.) Any acts of violence is forbidden while inside the bazaar and will be penalized accordingly.
6.) You may use any form of tactic to achieve your goals.
7.) You are given a cart that where you can put items you procure. It has a weight limit so be careful
8.) For the remainder of this floor, you will not be able to access your inventories when you are outside of the bazaar.
9.) And lastly, this person here will help you identify the value of each items/materials you present him with.



